{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Instants,&quot; a captivating journey that blends puzzle-solving, crafting and heartfelt storytelling. Build up a collection of family photo albums piece by piece and learn their stories in a nostalgic narrative puzzle game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/EN_1_Puzzle.png?t=1744877739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange the given family pictures chronologically within each album. The pictures serve as clues to their timeline, reflecting the natural evolution of a family story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1744877739\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/EN_2_Story.png?t=1744877739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> As you solve the puzzle, a heartwarming story will gradually emerge. Explore at your own pace and put together the tale of one family throughout the generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/Story.gif?t=1744877739\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/EN_3_Decoration.png?t=1744877739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Add your artistic flair and decorate the albums with backgrounds, stickers, typography, and more. Unlock new customization options as you progress and make each album an art piece in its own right! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/Decoration.gif?t=1744877739\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/EN_4_Relax.png?t=1744877739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Need a helping hand? Meet your adorable furry companion who offers optional assistance when facing challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/Cat.gif?t=1744877739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948560?t=1744877739","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948560?t=1744877739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744877739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744877739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3393220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>KEEP UP TO DATE!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/WishlistNow.gif?t=1744877739\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Instants,&quot; a captivating journey that blends puzzle-solving, crafting and heartfelt storytelling. Build up a collection of family photo albums piece by piece and learn their stories in a nostalgic narrative puzzle game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948560/extras/EN_1_Puzzle.png?t=174487